flowchart TD
    Req["turn/start (caller command ID)"] --> Seen{"Command ID already committed?"}
    Seen -->|"yes (retry / restart)"| Replay["Return original receipt; no constructor, no effect"]
    Seen -->|no| Check["Validate controller, pinned profile, effective budget"]
    Check --> Atomic["Atomic commit: task + turn + input capture + empty ledger + receipt"]
    Atomic --> Ticket["Mint controller-bound startup ticket (fresh acceptance only)"]
    Ticket --> Construct["Construct retained session (root_task launch selection)"]
    Construct --> Activate["Activate root"]
    Activate --> Submit["Submit accepted turn"]
    Submit --> Admission["Shared admission: original ceilings + absolute deadlines persist across reconnect / CLI resume"]
